%% bullets.mgp - gucOS MagicPoint showcase (todos/0185): tab-depth lists
%% and %icon shapes. Body lines below start with REAL tab characters.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "MidnightBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 5, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%tab 3 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "          ", icon delta3 "white" 40, left
%tab 4 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "              ", icon dia "orchid" 40, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Bullets

lists by tab depth
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Four depths

	one tab: a green box
	another top-level point
		two tabs: a gold arc
		arcs mark the second level
			three: a white delta
				four: an orchid diamond
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

A real outline

	what mgp gives you
		plain-text decks
		one page per page
	what this port keeps
		freetype text
		PNG / GIF / PBM / XBM / XPM images
	what it drops
		X child windows
		forked helpers
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Icon shapes

	box
		arc
			delta3
				dia
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
